.TH "SPACEMAP" "1" "2026\-08\-01"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
spacemap \- visualize and navigate yabai spaces
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBspacemap\fR [\fBOPTIONS\fR]
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Spacemap is a native macOS HUD for yabai spaces.\& With no options, it launches
the menu bar application and waits for the configured hotkey.\&
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB\-\-version\fR
.RS 4
Print the Spacemap version and exit.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB\-\-trigger\fR
.RS 4
Toggle the HUD in the running Spacemap application and exit.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB\-\-space\fR \fISELECTOR\fR
.RS 4
Focus a yabai space, show the HUD, and exit.\& \fISELECTOR\fR may be an index from
1 through 16, \fBprev\fR, \fBnext\fR, \fBfirst\fR, \fBlast\fR, \fBrecent\fR, \fBmouse\fR, or a yabai
space label.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB\-\-show\-menu\fR
.RS 4
Show the menu bar menu.\& The application continues running.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB\-\-settings\fR
.RS 4
Open the settings window.\& The application continues running.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB\-\-config\fR
.RS 4
Open the configuration file in the default editor and exit.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB\-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Print command\-line help and exit.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH FILES
.PP
\fI$HOME/.\&config/spacemap/config.\&toml\fR
.RS 4
Spacemap configuration.\& Most changes are reloaded when the HUD opens; hotkey
changes require the running application to restart.\&
.PP
.RE
\fI$HOME/.\&config/spacemap/themes/\fR
.RS 4
Directory containing custom \fB.\&smthemes\fR theme files.\&
.PP
.RE
\fI/tmp/spacemap_USERNAME.\&socket\fR
.RS 4
Unix domain socket used by the CLI and yabai signals to notify the running
application.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Toggle the running HUD:
.PP
.RS 4
spacemap \-\-trigger
.PP
.RE
Focus the next space from an skhd binding and show the HUD:
.PP
.RS 4
ctrl \- right : spacemap \-\-space next
.PP
.RE
Focus a labeled space:
.PP
.RS 4
spacemap \-\-space web
.PP
.RE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.PP
Spacemap discovers yabai at \fI/opt/homebrew/bin/yabai\fR or
\fI/usr/local/bin/yabai\fR.\&
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fByabai\fR(1), \fBskhd\fR(1)
.PP
.SH AUTHORS
.PP
Spacemap contributors.\&
